# Asher Architecture

The canonical architecture table, layer boundaries, and hard rules live in the project
`AGENTS.md`. Read it before changing architecture. Platform details:
`docs/Cross-Platform-Architecture.md`.

Cursor-specific reminders:

- Business logic stays in C# services; renderer JavaScript never reimplements service rules.
- New backend capability = new `IAsherApplication` method + JSONL, not ad-hoc IPC.
- `Asher.Core` stays UI-free (no WPF/Prism/MaterialDesign anywhere).
- OS-specific work goes behind `Asher.Services/Platform` contracts; do not branch on the OS in
  `GameInstallationService`, `GameFolderService`, `GameLaunchService`, or the renderer.
- Launcher/Runtime run inside the game process — keep them independent of Host.
